# CSPT Regex with Names

## Template Literal URL Path

```regex
`(?:https?:\/\/|\/)[^`]*\$\{[^}]+\}[^`]*`
```

---

## URL String + Variable

```regex
["'`](?:https?:\/\/|\/)[^"'`]*["'`]\s*\+\s*[a-zA-Z_$][\w.$]*
```

---

## Multiple URL Concats

```regex
["'`](?:https?:\/\/|\/)[^"'`]*["'`](?:\s*\+\s*[a-zA-Z_$][\w.$]*)+
```

---

## Dynamic Path Construction

```regex
(?:`[^`]*\$\{[^}]+\}[^`]*`|\+\s*[\w.]+\s*\+|"\s*\+\s*[\w.]+\s*|\$\{[^}]+\})
```

