- Account B IAM users: total 2 → `Id 97235517 testtttt`, `Id 87449062 admin12345` (admin).

### Active
- Investigating stored HTML/CSS injection in `/workorder/list/detail?id=<TicketID>` conversation rendering. No automatic JS execution vector confirmed; event handlers and dangerous tags stripped server-side. Likely only benign HTML/CSS injection.
- Inspecting message app JS for HTML rendering/sanitizer: downloaded 3 files to `/tmp/msg2` (`main.5bc4931c.js`, `337.8f0884ae.js`, `builder-runtime.e7955615.js`) — next step is to grep for `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`/sanitizer.
